{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Assessed against skua commit 7ee1f35af516 and the consolidated remainder fix. Skua's xdist-worker namespace did not cover the direct unit test path: before the remainder fix, the named completion wrapper test failed with GateCongestedError while four simulated operator slots were held. Gerrit change 2748 landed as 9ecefde2b3b1 and the named test plus the affected cluster passed under PYTEST_WORKERS=4 with operator slots held (165 passed in 50.41s). Closing this as duplicate of primary stuffed-energistic-ladybird."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788776264156981706,"uuid":"e73233c3-b76a-43a6-a86a-49656bf85fa6"}